e additional resources of those countries and controls the flow of Petroleum and access to the Hormuz and Red Sea it's gonna get even stickier once China and Russia start vying for more regional influence. \n\nJust my two cents...", "author": "Moebius", "created": 1786354845323, "profile_picture": "0F9hm63l5dUw", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "whatsthatsmell", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "So...If the US Pulls Out of the Middle East Completely, Within 5 Years Iran Will Have Taken Over Every Country Their Proxies Invaded Except Perhaps Egypt and Turkey...If the Israelis Don't Nuke Them First...", "last_comment_created": 1786364391828, "content": "<p>Iran already controls Iraq through their 'Security Forces', most of Yemen through the Houthis and are only a few assassinations away from taking over Lebanon.  While Saudi Arabia has a more advanced military, Iran outnumbers them 3:1.  Jordan will make a deal as will Syria just to avoid an all out war.</p>\n<p>Once Iran gathers the additional resources of those countries and controls the flow of Petroleum and access to the Hormuz and Red Sea it's gonna get even stickier once China and Russia start vying for more regional influence.</p>\n<p>Just my two cents...</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 5, "score_up": 15, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}], "status": true}